  title: Night Watch
  briefing: 'Radar reports small drones approaching the installation.


    You are on the ZU-23-2. Drag on the left side of the screen to aim, hold FIRE with your right thumb. Brackets mark targets on screen; arrows at the edge point to targets you can''t see.


    Moving targets need leading: aim at the amber ring.


    Objective: survive three waves with the installation intact.'
